3
00:01:33.000 --> 00:02:08.000
His 2018 book, A Recent History of Lesbian and Gay Psychology, from Homophobia to LGBT, traces the psychological research on these issues since the 1970s. He was also guest editor of a special issue of APA's journal American Psychologist, entitled 50 Years Since Stonewall, The Science and Politics of Sexual Orientation and Gender Diversity. In addition to his work in the history of psychology, He conducts experimental research in areas including auditory Gaydar and how beliefs about the biological basis of sexual orientation influence prejudice and discrimination.
他2018年的著作《女同性恋和男同性恋心理学简史：从恐同到LGBT》追溯了自20世纪70年代以来关于这些议题的心理学研究。他还是美国心理学会期刊《美国心理学家》特刊的客座编辑，该特刊题为《石墙事件50周年：性取向和性别多样性的科学与政治》。除了在心理学史方面的工作外，他还进行实验研究，领域包括听觉“同志雷达”（Gaydar），以及关于性取向生物学基础的信念如何影响偏见和歧视。

